cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Sift QDA in your research, please cite it as below, including the version you used."
title: "Sift QDA: local-first qualitative data analysis"
abstract: >-
  Sift QDA is free, open-source software for qualitative data analysis that keeps research data on
  the researcher's own computer. It supports coding of documents, PDFs, survey data and transcribed
  audio, matrix coding and coding queries, local semantic search and a local AI assistant, and
  exchange with other CAQDAS tools through the REFI-QDA standard.
type: software
authors:
